# auto-review 2026-10-09: corrected
#: appGUI/preferences/excellon/ExcellonGenPrefGroupUI.py:232
#: appGUI/preferences/geometry/GeometryGenPrefGroupUI.py:79
msgid ""
"This sets the path optimization algorithm.\n"
"- Rtre -> Rtree algorithm\n"
"- MetaHeuristic -> Google OR-Tools algorithm with\n"
"MetaHeuristic Guided Local Path is used. Default search time is 3sec.\n"
"- Basic -> Using Google OR-Tools Basic algorithm\n"
"- TSA -> Using Travelling Salesman algorithm\n"
"\n"
"Some options are disabled when the application works in 32bit mode."
msgstr ""
"Define o algoritmo de otimização de caminho.\n"
"- Rtre -> algoritmo Rtree\n"
"- MetaHeuristic -> é usado o algoritmo Google OR-Tools com\n"
"MetaHeuristic Guided Local Path. O tempo de pesquisa padrão é de 3 s.\n"
"- Básico -> algoritmo básico do Google OR-Tools\n"
"- TSA -> algoritmo do Caixeiro Viajante (Travelling Salesman)\n"
"\n"
